9", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9tLiJhYUsoIQ7kNvwEnpsBn&_nc_oc=AdqNRwB5DKjb6GD8tRIZNhUWdqOZ4jV4iOGsCXVy2Fd0o8H89xZKfd6N55Wbe9ro7Yg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP1CYXVIygIHnG7MMjRGnTY4DSOOj8NfMeEdt6AunzlSQ&oe=6ACCE1DB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mEv-xp8yXGUQ7kNvwFISDJY&_nc_oc=AdqF-MUb5Y9Dh69Kcuaf-se7re2YypqqEZdHH9GV1z8Tv2Q4q4wn6Tm8-EE5HNTc18Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMlE7n3bY2vD5qCXxffRXWxXP1RZBAaBTWpZVSK5Q-gzA&oe=6ACCE181"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pbV-Ln1CZ90Q7kNvwGW-M0M&_nc_oc=AdrEc-2EnCE1WltOsH4HxJg-35xM4bMLk07592oxaPOir5DjWUqHiYAIk5JfBTQHDQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPWsfqfoDeRnATzyA7UpZ9N9rLMXcQkcf3tq0FHx_dJ2A&oe=6ACD059D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aC7fxxr6H3AQ7kNvwFH9rWa&_nc_oc=Adph2JH3pHqRPQMf_Ks7ImKdaVehTLTMxkTTxWYoKURbUPmcgmS7HUT1PSD3L0z69YE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPEGRuWgubHzyJ_JoJoh1vDuMLaAI09zIf6XlakfcZJ2A&oe=6ACD077F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tH62mZF71ggQ7kNvwGUrgDv&_nc_oc=AdpzEhPQCEOxHeJe7J5H9E0ID4XFSaY-oASUJ7zyxh_fu4yRG8-uGgvr3dMH40CoTpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPPKS17taYtqoheF9nFIThtMo5_j81ERHE8wliYgr7NGQ&oe=6ACCFBEE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4H74-eBAltYQ7kNvwEMNnq-&_nc_oc=AdoavKLqQ5mndBMUZnzQG4VMMkSvp0fL5jOanqLjeuaxlmWAMhAZew0nQmzxARt8wLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNkXrF-ZjOIRhxEFqTvzws3eIU-KD4OHc3b7XfsIugBYw&oe=6ACCF4DF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L